# Tools the in-container agent authors live here. Bind-mounted from
# host repo; on PATH via seed.sh; survives container restart and image
# rebuild because the directory is in git.
#
# Conventions:
# - One executable per file (Python / bash / Ruby / etc; chmod +x).
# - Name maps directly to the command users invoke (no extension).
# - When you add a tool, append a row to /docs/SKILL_ROUTING.md.
#
# See /docs/HARNESS_SELF_EXTENSION.md for the full self-extension
# doctrine.
